    "df696699-42a8-4b2a-8976-674c3e309cd21": {
      "type": "featured-accordion",
      "blocks": {
        "d7624e53-96f3-43a2-a5b4-052847d8844f": {
          "type": "entry",
          "settings": {
            "full_width_enable": true,
            "title": "Why is the dirt pick-up under performing?",
            "text": "<p>This can be caused by:<br/><br/>1. Dirty water tank is not installed correctly. Check the dirty water tank for correct installation. Ensure it is installed in place.<br/>2. Dirty water tank is full. Empty the dirty water tank.<br/>3. The suction hose is clogged. Clean the hose.<br/>4. Float value is activated. Empty the dirty water tank</p>",
            "button_1_style": "white",
            "button_1_text": "",
            "button_1_url": "/",
            "button_2_style": "link",
            "button_2_text": "",
            "button_2_url": "/",
            "product_specifications": "",
            "html": "",
            "collection": "",
            "collection_products_per_page": 8,
            "products": [],
            "image_loading": "",
            "video_1": "",
            "video_2": ""
          }
        },
        "80d3ee7d-e860-4a9c-8b84-2c5508cdf136": {
          "type": "entry",
          "settings": {
            "full_width_enable": true,
            "title": "Why is no solution spraying out?",
            "text": "<p>This can be caused by: <br/><br/>1. Clean water tank is empty. Fill the clean water tank.<br/>2. Clean water tank is not installed correctly. Check the clean water tank for correct installation. Ensure it is installed in place.<br/>3. The cleaner is overheated. Unplug the power cord and let the cleaner cool down for 30 minutes. Restart the cleaner. If the problem persists, contact the after sales helpline.</p>",
            "button_1_style": "black",
            "button_1_text": "",
            "button_1_url": "",
            "button_2_style": "",
            "button_2_text": "",
